"notes":[
{"series":"gem.aum","key":"all","rule":"sum of the four fund-type rows (gemel, study funds, central severance, investment gemel) of the parent's table 'data on the provident funds managed by Y.L. Gemel'; equals the printed 'total' row at every balance date (Dec-20 to Dec-25). Balance dates exist only at 31 December: no March / June / September balance is extracted."},
{"series":"gem.fees","key":"all","rule":"'הכנסות מניהול קופות גמל' from the statements of Yelin Lapidot Holdings (100%, associate of the parent), the only P&L line extracted. The group's holding company manages all the group's provident funds, so this is the provident management-fee income; no segment note of the managing company itself is extracted."},
{"series":"gem.tr_in / tr_out / dep / out_rate","key":"all","rule":"not built: the parent's table prints 'deposits, clearing fees and transfers in' and 'withdrawals and transfers out' as combined columns (FY2023-FY2025). Transfers cannot be separated from deposits or from withdrawals, and the tables are not printed at all in the interim reports. The combined columns are not used as tr_in / tr_out."},
{"series":"gem.sm / ga / op / gross_m / op_m / sm_fees / sm_aum / ga_fees / ga_aum","key":"all","rule":"not built: no selling-and-marketing or general-and-administrative expense of the provident funds is printed (the parent prints expenses only for the whole Yelin Lapidot group; the holding's notes give DAC amortisation 42.173 / 26.094 and 'provident funds operations' 18.713 / 16.435 / 13.146, which are not S&M or G&A and are not mapped)."},
{"series":"gem.aum","key":"2026-06","rule":"not built: no Jun-2026 (or any 2026) balance in the extraction, so the deck's 82 and every H1-2026 / quarterly average-assets metric (fee_a H1-2026 0.657, Q-rates) have no opening-or-closing balance."}
]}
